# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — concurrencpp 0.1.7 CMake 头文件安装子目录 → includedirs 不匹配 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-02
# Software: concurrencpp 0.1.7
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package) — PR #7620
# Status: DRAFT — 需人工/AI 审核后 promote 为 E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. 审核 error_excerpt 与实际验证
#   2. 改名为 E0XX.kv 并移动到 knowledge/graph/
#   3. 在 knowledge/graph/index.tsv 添加一行
#   4. 编写 knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-concurrencpp-0.1.7-cmake-header-install-subdir
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|clang++
phase:                  testing|test_package|package
error_signature:        fatal error: '.+\.h' file not found|
                         test_package.*: fatal error.*file not found|
                         Error in build\(\) method.*test package

severity:               2
category:               headers, cmake, conan, packaging
match_keywords:         includedirs, cpp_info.includedirs, test_package, header,
                         CMakeLists install, DESTINATION include, INSTALL_INTERFACE,
                         include/<subdir>, find_package, CMakeDeps, fatal error, file not found
title:                  CMake 上游把公共头安装到 include/<subdir>（如 include/<lib>-<version>）且
                         INSTALL_INTERFACE 未导出 include 路径时，conan 模板配方默认
                         includedirs=[include] 不匹配 → test_package 找不到头文件，需在
                         package_info() 显式声明 includedirs

root_cause: >
  上游 CMakeLists.txt 用 install(DIRECTORY include/ DESTINATION include/<subdir>) 把公共头
  安装到版本化子目录（concurrencpp 为 include/concurrencpp-0.1.7/），且 target_include_directories
  仅用 $<BUILD_INTERFACE:...> 包裹、未声明 $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:...>，导出的 CMake target
  不带安装 include 路径。conan 模板配方 package_info() 默认 includedirs=["include"]，
  与实际安装位置 include/<subdir> 不匹配；消费者 find_package 后 include 解析失败，
  test_package 的 #include <lib/...> 找不到头文件，G2 在 test_package 阶段失败。

trigger_condition: >
  上游 CMake 把公共头安装至 include/<subdir>（常为 include/<lib>-<version>/）；
  消费者测试以 #include <lib/...> 形式引用（前缀即子目录）；
  配方 package_info() 未同步声明实际 includedirs。

solution: >
  conanfile.py package_info() 显式声明 cpp_info.includedirs 指向实际子目录：
    self.cpp_info.libs = ["concurrencpp"]
    self.cpp_info.includedirs = ["include/concurrencpp-0.1.7"]
    self.cpp_info.set_property("cmake_file_name", "concurrencpp")
    self.cpp_info.set_property("cmake_target_name", "concurrencpp::concurrencpp")
  同时 test_package test() 用 self.run 直接执行消费者二进制（满足 L0d 门禁）。

verification: >
  R02 复验：conan create (ohos-aarch64) 通过，G0-G4 + L2/L4/L5 全门禁 PASS；
  HarmonyOS 专项测试（runtime/thread_executor/lazy_result 协程）编译运行 PASS
  （sum=36, unique_threads=8, coroutine_sum=42）；上游测试 150/150 通过。
  证据日志含 SHA-256：~/ohpcd-evidence/concurrencpp-0.1.7/special_test_audit.log、
  local_gate_revalidation.log、upstream_test_ledger.log。

applicability: >
  所有 CMake 工程把公共头安装到 include/<subdir>（include/libairspyhf、
  include/libusb-1.0、include/<lib>-<version> 等）且消费者 #include <lib/...>
  的场景；上游 INSTALL_INTERFACE 未导出安装 include 路径、或导出子目录与
  模板 includedirs 不一致时均适用。

counterexample: >
  上游把头平铺安装到 include/ 根（install(DIRECTORY include/ DESTINATION include)）
  时模板默认 includedirs 已正确，无需修改；header-only 库仅 include 无 libs，
  但 includedirs 仍需与安装子目录匹配。

recovery_condition: >
  撤销 package_info.includedirs 修改后，test_package 将再次报
  'concurrencpp/concurrencpp.h' file not found，G2 门禁回退失败。

